NOTE ON BUNDLED ART ASSETS

The MIT License in LICENSE covers the whole repository, including the built-in
"plain" theme pack (resources/themes/plain). That pack is generated by
scripts/theme-packs/plain/gen_pack.py from flat geometric shapes and contains no
third-party artwork. Characters are drawn procedurally in
src/renderer/src/scene/office/portraitArt.ts.

Third-party theme packs (for example ones built from commercial tilesets) are NOT
part of this repository. Install them in your themes folder or via MD_THEMES_DIR
and follow the licence of whoever made them. See docs/theming/THEMING.md.
